[44.117857, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[14B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m pattern, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory, called typo3-dev-companion \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m times, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe installation already has its full page tree, but 16 pages have no content yet. I'm reading the\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdesign's texts and images so I can write a matching seed script in Build/Initialisation/.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[19Gcommand…\r\u001b[40C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mought for 7s)\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
