u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml.f\u001b[16Gles/\u001b[39m. Record counts for\u001b[40Gall\u001b[50Gtable\u001b[56G are unchang\u001b[69Gd.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe sitep\u001b[15Gckage README\u001b[28Glists\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gnew\u001b[42Gscript\u001b[49Gand\u001b[53Gdescribes\u001b[63Gthe\u001b[67Gcontent.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mChanges beyond content.\u001b[22m Withou\u001b[34G these, the pages didn't look right:\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mImage layout:\u001b[22m the site\u001b[28Gd\u001b[30Gdn't load fluid_s\u001b[48Gyle\u001b[52G_content'\u001b[63GCSS, so images\u001b[78Gnever\u001b[84Gsat\u001b[88Gbeside\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gtext.\u001b[105GI\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Badded\u001b[11G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/fluid-styled-content-css\u001b[42G\u001b[39mto\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Gsite\u001b[54Gset's\u001b[60Gdependencies.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mStyles:\u001b[22m I added a table style\u001b[35Gin the\u001b[42Gdesign's colours\u001b[59Gand made images\u001b[75Gsit\u001b[79Gabove\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtext\u001b[94Gon\u001b[97Gsmall\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gscreens, where the side-by-side layout squeez\u001b[52G the text into a narrow column.\u001b[84GThe\u001b[88Gchang\u001b[94Gs are in\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m_components.scss\u001b[39m, with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain.css\u001b[39m rebuilt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mEditors:\u001b[22m the \"Editors\" group gets a new \"Page\u001b[51Gimages\"\u001b[59Gfile mount for the new folder. This only applies\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bto n\u001b[10Gw installa\u001b[21Gion\u001b[25G. In this one, the\u001b[44Ggroup \u001b[51Gxists\u001b[57Galready and\u001b[69Gwould need the\u001b[84Gmount \u001b[91Gdd\u001b[94Gd\u001b[96Gin the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bbackend.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[385.78196, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mE-services portal, Access to information, Tenders\u001b[22m:\u001b[56Gtext\u001b[61Gwith\u001b[66Gan\u001b[69Gimage;\u001b[76GAccess\u001b[83Gto\u001b[86Ginformation\u001b[98Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GTenders also have a list or table.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mAccessibility statement, Privacy policy\u001b[22m:\u001b[46Gthese\u001b[52Gsay\u001b[56Gthey\u001b[61Gare\u001b[65Gplaceholders.\u001b[79GTheir\u001b[85Greal\u001b[90Gtext\u001b[95Gis\u001b[98Gfor\u001b[102Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gmunicipality to write, so I didn't invent l\u001b[49Ggal tex\u001b[57G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mImages\u001b[22m: 16 flat\u001b[21GSVG drawings \u001b[35Gn the design's green, red\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Ggold,\u001b[71Geach\u001b[76Gwith\u001b[81Galternative\u001b[93Gtext.\u001b[99GThey\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gland in\u001b[13G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfileadmin/user_upload/pages/\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mHow it's built\u001b[18G\u001b[22m(following\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Gproject's\u001b[43Gexisting\u001b[52Gpattern)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mBuild/Initialisation/seed-pages.php\u001b[39m write\u001b[47G the\u001b[52Gcon\u001b[57Gnt,\u001b[61Gand\u001b[65Gits\u001b[69Gdrawings\u001b[78Gare\u001b[82Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[26G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mimages/\u001b[39m. Like the other seed scripts, it refuses to\u001b[78Grun\u001b[83Gf\u001b[85Gany\u001b[89Gof\u001b[92Gthose\u001b[98Gpages\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Balready has content.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GI \u001b[9G-exported \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInitialisation/data.xml\u001b[43G\u001b[39mand\u001b[47Greplaced\u001b[56Git\u001b[59Gwith\u001b[64Gthe\u001b[68Gnew\u001b[72Gexport,\u001b[80Gadding\u001b[87G16\u001b[90Gfiles\u001b[96Gto\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdata.xml.files/\u001b[39m. Record counts for all other t\u001b[52Gbles are unchanged.\u001b[72G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GThe sitepackage README lists the new script and d\u001b[56Gcribes t\u001b[65Ge content.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mChanges beyond content.\u001b[27G\u001b[22mWithout\u001b[35Gthese,\u001b[42Gthe\u001b[46Gpages\u001b[52Gdidn't\u001b[59Glook\u001b[64Gright:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mImage\u001b[11Gla\u001b[15Gut:\u001b[22m the site didn'\u001b[35Gload fluid_styled_co\u001b[56Gtent's CSS, so\u001b[71Gimages\u001b[78Gnever\u001b[84Gsat\u001b[88Gbeside\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gtext.\u001b[105GI\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gadded \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/fluid-styled-content-css\u001b[39m to the site se\u001b[57G's dependencies.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStyles:\u001b[22m I added a table style in the\u001b[42Gdesign'\u001b[50G colours and ma\u001b[67G images\u001b[75Gsit\u001b[79Gabove\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtext\u001b[94Gon\u001b[97Gsmall\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gscreens, wher\u001b[19G the sid\u001b[28G-by-side layout \u001b[45Gqueezed the text into a n\u001b[71Grrow column. The changes are in\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m_components.scss\u001b[39m, with \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain.css\u001b[37G\u001b[39mrebuilt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEditors:\u001b[22m the \"Editors\"\u001b[28Ggroup gets a new \"Page\u001b[51Gimages\"\u001b[59Gfile\u001b[64Gmount\u001b[70Gfor\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gnew\u001b[82Gfolder.\u001b[90GThis\u001b[95Gonly\u001b[100Gapplies\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gto new installat\u001b[22Gons. In this one, th\u001b[43G group exists already and would n\u001b[77Ged the mount\u001b[90Gadded in the\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bback\u001b[10Gnd.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done yet:\u001b[17G\u001b[22mI\u001b[19Ghaven't\u001b[27Gtested\u001b[34Gthe\u001b[38Gimport\u001b[45Gon\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50Gfresh\u001b[56Ginstallation.\u001b[70GThat\u001b[