[1184.447914, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mImage layout:\u001b[22m the site didn'\u001b[34G load\u001b[40Gf\u001b[42Guid_styled_content's CSS, so images\u001b[78Gnever\u001b[84Gsat\u001b[88Gbeside\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gtext.\u001b[105GI\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gadded \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtypo3/fluid-styled-content-css\u001b[42G\u001b[39mto the\u001b[49Gsite set's dependencies.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mStyles:\u001b[13G\u001b[22mI\u001b[15Gadded\u001b[21Ga\u001b[23Gtable\u001b[29Gstyle\u001b[35Gin\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gdesign's\u001b[51Gcolours\u001b[59Gand\u001b[63Gmade\u001b[68Gimages\u001b[75Gsit\u001b[79Gabove\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtext\u001b[94Gon\u001b[97Gsmall\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  screens, where the side-by-side layou\u001b[43G squeezed the \u001b[58Gext into a narrow\u001b[76Gcolumn.\u001b[84GThe\u001b[88Gchanges\u001b[96Gare\u001b[100Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m_components.scss\u001b[39m,\u001b[23Gw\u001b[26Gh\u001b[28G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmain.css\u001b[39m rebuilt.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEditors:\u001b[22m the \"Editors\" group gets a new\u001b[45G\"Page imag\u001b[56Gs\" file mou\u001b[68Gt for\u001b[74Gthe\u001b[78Gnew\u001b[82Gfolder.\u001b[90GThis\u001b[95Gonly\u001b[100Gapplies\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gto new installations. In \u001b[31Ghis\u001b[35Go\u001b[37Ge, the group exists already and would\u001b[75Gneed the mount added in the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bback\u001b[11Gd.\u001b[14G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done yet:\u001b[22m I haven't tested\u001b[34Gthe import\u001b[45Gon a fresh insta\u001b[62Glatio\u001b[68G.\u001b[70GThat m\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gs the README's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mddev delete\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bprocedure, which would wipe this database. I can run it if you want. To\u001b[75Gundo\u001b[84Gseed here, ru\u001b[99G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mddev \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bsnapshot restore before-seed-pages\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2BScreenshots are\u001b[19Gin \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/tmp/claude-1000/-home-lina-wolf-projects-typo3-t3ca-2026-demo/b6f2d3ef-aa61-40d6-82a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5-060ccc03595e/scratchpad/\u001b[39m,\u001b[31Gfor ex\u001b[38Gmple \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrevenue-payments-land-rates.png\u001b[75G\u001b[39ma\u001b[78G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmobile-health.png\u001b[39m. I can\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdraft a commit message when you want\u001b[40Gone.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 6m 13s · done 6:00 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mThe 16 empty menu pages now have example text and images, re-exported into the sitepackage's \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdata.xml, uncommitted. Next: decide whether I test the import on a fresh install, which wipes this \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mdatabase, or draft a commit message. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[23m\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mpictures need a lightbox where you can see them full size after a click\u001b[39m                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3GSeasoning… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt\u001b[39m\u001b[31;1H\u001b[29;3H\u001b[?25h"]
