[1193.032237, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G\u001b[1mEditors:\u001b[22m the \"Editors\"\u001b[28Ggroup gets a new \"Page images\" file mount for the\u001b[80Gw folder. This\u001b[95Gonly applies\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bto new installations. In this one, the group exists already and would\u001b[75Gneed\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Gmount\u001b[90Gadded\u001b[96Gin\u001b[99Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gbackend.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNot done yet:\u001b[22m I haven'\u001b[26G tested the impor\u001b[44G on\u001b[48Ga\u001b[50Gfresh\u001b[56Ginstallation.\u001b[70GThat\u001b[75Gmeans\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85GREADME's\u001b[94G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mddev delete\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mprocedure,\u001b[14Gw\u001b[16Gich would wipe this dat\u001b[40Gbase. I can run it\u001b[59Gif you want. To undo the se\u001b[87Gd here,\u001b[95Grun \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mddev \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msnapshot restore before-seed-pages\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BScreenshots\u001b[15Gare\u001b[19Gin\u001b[22G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/tmp/claude-1000/-home-lina-wolf-projects-typo3-t3ca-2026-demo/b6f2d3ef-aa61-40d6-82a\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B5-060ccc03595e/scratchpad/\u001b[39m, for example \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrevenue-payments-land-rates.png\u001b[75G\u001b[39mand \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmobile-health.png\u001b[39m. I can\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bd\u001b[5Gaft a commit message\u001b[27Ghen\u001b[31Gyou wan\u001b[39G one.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 6m 13s · done 6:00 PM\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m※\u001b[3G\u001b[1mrecap: \u001b[22m\u001b[3mThe 16 empty menu pages now have example text and images, re-exported into the sitepackage's \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdata.xml, uncommitted. Next: decide whether I test the import on a fresh install, which wipes this \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1